flowchart LR
  H[Every user's Home page] --> U[Learn]
  U --> M{Exercise mode}
  M -->|At My Desk| L[Desk simulation]
  M -->|Onsite| L2[Onsite simulation]
  L2 --> C
  L --> C[Coach supplies diagnostic question and why]
  C --> F[Isolated Fred training coach]
  F --> N1[Mandatory TRAINING EXERCISE notice]
  F --> N2[No production tools or hidden answer]
  L --> C[Coach supplies diagnostic question and why]
  C --> P[Open relevant Hub page]
  P --> K[Run predetermined simulated check]
  K --> E[Observe result and interpret evidence]
  E --> D{Choose next action}
  D -->|misdirected| X[Explain consequence and retry]
  X --> C
  D -->|supported| N[Advance investigation]
  N --> R{Identified or resolved?}
  R -->|no| C
  R -->|yes| O[Resolve, escalate, and document]
  O --> DB[(Per-user scenario progress)]
